WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.740
I try to be an optimist,

00:00:01.740 --> 00:00:04.390
even in these dark times.

00:00:04.390 --> 00:00:05.510
And one of the things
I wanted to talk about

00:00:05.510 --> 00:00:07.810
is ever since COVID started everyone

00:00:07.810 --> 00:00:09.710
has been trapped inside.

00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:10.650
And you know what I say?

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:13.760
That's a great time to
take up a new hobby.

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:14.680
Look at the positive!

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:16.430
Great time to pick up a hobby.

00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:18.960
So I've taken up an incredible new hobby

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:21.489
I am really excited to
share with you guys.

00:00:21.489 --> 00:00:23.820
I'm going to show you in a segment called

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:26.105
Conan's New Hobby.

00:00:26.105 --> 00:00:27.559
(intense music)

00:00:27.559 --> 00:00:28.585
♪ Conan's new hobby ♪

00:00:28.585 --> 00:00:29.577
♪ What's it gonna be? ♪

00:00:29.577 --> 00:00:30.651
♪ Conan's new hobby ♪

00:00:30.651 --> 00:00:33.734
♪ Let's wait and see ♪

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:44.150
Okay, check this out:

00:00:44.150 --> 00:00:46.703
I've been getting into origami.

00:00:47.820 --> 00:00:51.070
Look at this guy, a
little frog right there.

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:51.940
Pretty cool, huh?

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:55.090
And I got a bird right here,

00:00:55.090 --> 00:00:57.250
kind of a crane sort of gull,

00:00:57.250 --> 00:01:01.163
and then a little, I don't know, flower.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.200
What do you think, Andy?

00:01:04.380 --> 00:01:07.490
They're nice, but they're
a little underwhelming.

00:01:07.490 --> 00:01:08.653
Let's just say that.

00:01:09.640 --> 00:01:10.740
Okay.

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:11.900
It's just that I'm still learning.

00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:13.690
You know, I just started.

00:01:13.690 --> 00:01:16.330
Well, it's just kinda disappointing,

00:01:16.330 --> 00:01:20.250
especially after that
exciting intro package.

00:01:20.250 --> 00:01:22.750
I just sorta expected more.

00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:24.090
Yeah.

00:01:24.090 --> 00:01:26.610
Honestly, I didn't know about the intro.

00:01:26.610 --> 00:01:30.200
I didn't think they'd make
such a huge deal about it

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:32.550
and then they made that crazy intro.

00:01:32.550 --> 00:01:35.480
And it's just hard to follow.

00:01:35.480 --> 00:01:38.090
I know, well frankly,

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:39.763
you kinda let us all down.

00:01:42.356 --> 00:01:43.332
(beep) you, Andy!

00:01:43.332 --> 00:01:45.133
♪ Conan's new hobby ♪

00:01:45.133 --> 00:01:46.555
♪ Conan's new hobby ♪

00:01:46.555 --> 00:01:47.388
♪ Conan's new hobby! ♪

00:01:47.388 --> 00:01:50.471
(lightning striking)

